    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Yin cloud Gu comes out of the aperture like a flash of light, lightly explodes, and turns into a dark black cloud. That cloud sinks, circulates within itself, and lands on the ground, placing Fang Yuan above the cloud layer. The black cloud is softer than a cushion, but slightly colder.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Yang cloud Gu is a white light that tears through the air and explodes into pure white mist. Once the white cloud appears, it wants to rise, then senses the black cloud below. The two cloud layers have a formless attraction to each other and keep rolling internally, looking after one another. One sits below Fang Yuan, the other above his head. The gloomy cloud is like ink, and the bright cloud is like foam.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan uses them carefully, both clouds move rapidly, like two thick carpets filling the secret room. One white cloud covers the ceiling. One black cloud covers the floor. Blue lightning connects the two.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "As the black and white clouds converge, lightning appears. Traces of blue lightning flash between them, then multiply until they form a field of lightning.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses that lightning to destroy a wild boar phantom left from black and white boar Gu. Lightning specializes in destruction and contains a destruction law fragment. After a thunderstorm, new life grows. Trapping the phantom in a lightning cage makes it show signs of disappearing.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_black_and_white_boar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Getting rid of that boar phantom by this method would take at least nineteen days. The cooperation of Yin Yang dual cloud Gu to summon lightning is the most common and cheap method.",
        "chapters": [
          297
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
